@Gateway.Service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5081

### Gateway health probe
GET {{Gateway.Service_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain

### Rejected: no Authorization header (expect 401)
GET {{Gateway.Service_HostAddress}}/api/identity/users
Accept: application/json

### Rejected: malformed Authorization header (expect 401)
GET {{Gateway.Service_HostAddress}}/api/identity/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer not-a-jwt

### Pass-through: valid JWT shape, forwarded to Identity Service
GET {{Gateway.Service_HostAddress}}/api/identity/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0In0.SflKxwRJSMeKKF2QT4fwpMeJf36POk6yJV_adQssw5c

### Pass-through: valid JWT shape, forwarded to Resource Service
GET {{Gateway.Service_HostAddress}}/api/resource/weatherforecast
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0In0.SflKxwRJSMeKKF2QT4fwpMeJf36POk6yJV_adQssw5c
